      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "543d286f9557245f95b0bedccf6dba40a771b07b7b021ff0ec13d6f3903a5c84",
       :raw
       "- `R6-ATOMIC` for unsupported memory order, scope, alignment, or target feature.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/604b2046503954470bbc35f393ddd2fb6de51960e40a7316636bf659e191afdd",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/1897593956a199304e680cc3",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 4933,
       :start-byte 4852}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "850995aec6b04c951a502dbc64838161f8875a2e0290a33dd11decaca75d524c",
       :raw
       "The concurrency runtime provides selected execution models for safe parallel and\nconcurrent Gravity code: atomics, locks, structured tasks, async futures,\nchannels, actors, scheduler integration, durable workflow steps, and AI agent\nexecution.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/d640414f36b49af9be263f57179ff8b09fe7ddc22d875ec8afd6e549ea7b73c9",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/19a6953e639ae492d4af91ad",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 568,
       :start-byte 324}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "c72bb8f5be3f2042ed43ba1ca39b9e8f124ffdcb2f9d856425677a41c52fb65e",
       :raw
       "Synchronization records include lock identity, guard lifetime, atomic memory\norder, condition variables, channels, actor mailboxes, work queues, barriers, and\nhost scheduler constraints. Actors and channels require schemas for messages and\nrules for ownership transfer.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/32841547155adf163a3fce86ee0107d2254c51e451e683740fc780d3986966d0",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/1a474faaabd0dde073978d5d",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 4172,
       :start-byte 3902}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "f34e1bafdb06a536c997732d9935725bff9c0833849f2d14e885249e22fca20f",
       :raw
       "Diagnostics must include source span, task/actor/channel id, profile, runtime\nfamily, scheduler, effect, capability, synchronization object, missing proof or\nschema, and remediation.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/e9571b0e29864aab72167c671a13ccf0c67cfad58eaa378a4dd0d8b2ae469c24",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/20d7a0f8dd7690fab68d8ee9",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5586,
       :start-byte 5403}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "1430ab7b2c9c41564fd5947d8ba5b7d041cb07c25798188dde1d8523b3e65d40",
       :raw "- `SAFE8` defines concurrency and data-race rules.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c7d500ea911c55129411ac12c82ace17ceceb0d5bddaeda3f537f8d7a90960c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/33175ff1df97271c915c9e91",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1770,
       :start-byte 1719}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "5d06c89261e46665c58dcb166f3dbda13adf8f8b4879234a77bf12791a2cd698",
       :raw
       "The runtime enforces the compiler's data-race, ownership-transfer,\nsynchronization, cancellation, and effect-ordering contracts. It is not a way to\nshare mutable state outside `SAFE8`.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/f6b7baa3619e09c90af8aed3561859597dd0116c6b0efa1390e28ec76a5742f6",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/4ae94841bf49c7264a95b908",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 754,
       :start-byte 569}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "3488bedbd4797d909aa15c22e0e06929f1f4965dbeb0201969825699c168d8b8",
       :raw
       "- The runtime manifest must declare selected concurrency model, scheduler,\n  thread provider, task lifecycle, cancellation policy, failure propagation,\n  memory-order support, and replay behavior when durable execution is involved.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/2defdcdbd78609242dd38b2c58c99a10b8d6aa903e591ba660ef400c9416f959",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/5438fe5d9e9d6aeea691cc91",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1004,
       :start-byte 772}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "805c074f5727fc7d35a639289239c6ccb78a2d8bb3c5a45be1dfeefdb7d06183",
       :raw "- atomics, locks, channels, and actor schema fixtures,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/5d7934ecbed7a4d7364acde0ecefa6a0bc4928020c8473c10b0512b65ad4323e",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/6f2efb3ba70a6605d61b9801",
       :kind :acceptance-case,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 6197,
       :start-byte 6142}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "32cbdfbe7d3202cf06eafb16208bb923176c9b8fe36723616453289a8d1ae4cc",
       :raw
       "- rejection of races, orphan tasks, unsupported atomics, and missing schemas,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/5d7934ecbed7a4d7364acde0ecefa6a0bc4928020c8473c10b0512b65ad4323e",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/791406261e8f5bdfffae6674",
       :kind :acceptance-case,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 6275,
       :start-byte 6197}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "43ce5e4dd14cff94a887fbc8d9f9e1ee092be8a74a317ee85a44a401354bfcfe",
       :raw
       "Runtime checks may detect data-race risks in debug builds, but compile-time\n`SAFE8` evidence remains authoritative.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/c803d0942ef417949524c51b26587ef0a3075c8bcf59f871a2a74598dd0c3a06",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/79d1a9c98289605982ec811f",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 4289,
       :start-byte 4173}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "6a6a978754046319f8bdcc988ddcf33fa5d8f7fee08251f26b52b72f12f5e3de",
       :raw
       "- `R6-RACE` for shared mutable state without accepted synchronization or\n  transfer evidence.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/604b2046503954470bbc35f393ddd2fb6de51960e40a7316636bf659e191afdd",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/8b33caf860f813edb7cacbec",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 4852,
       :start-byte 4758}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "7268db605092d291574e4a22e6065a7ba237e023e9e52a6ca40ad09605f4b085",
       :raw
       "- Shared mutable state across concurrent execution requires atomics, locks,\n  actors, channels, STM-like provider, ownership transfer, or proof of\n  isolation.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/2defdcdbd78609242dd38b2c58c99a10b8d6aa903e591ba660ef400c9416f959",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/904e78222fbf6d6b201b8a8c",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1164,
       :start-byte 1004}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "8aed2f6627571e873918f695c3e8129dc23a5a01c636061ce69e0cd6045ad61c",
       :raw
       "- Atomics must record operation, memory order, synchronization scope, alignment,\n  and target support.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/2defdcdbd78609242dd38b2c58c99a10b8d6aa903e591ba660ef400c9416f959",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/9778eb1c80faece680a20ecf",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1267,
       :start-byte 1164}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "c99693b36f847ee79b0e752e52dc40dab1d9015f582627c0e0fdf61623884946",
       :raw
       "```clojure\n{:artifact :gravity/concurrency-runtime\n :family :concurrency\n :models #{:structured-tasks :atomics :channels :actors}\n :scheduler :native-thread-pool\n :requires #{:ownership-transfer :sync-policy :cancellation-policy}\n :records #{:task-tree :sync-graph :actor-mailboxes}\n :rejects #{:unsynchronized-shared-mutable-state :orphan-task\n            :unreplayable-side-effect}}\n```\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0000880fa314d950b6c2c9fd69af7955b87c043981d9ac30f76b4996b3c56400",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/a89c8ca9cb1677c9e771db65",
       :kind :example,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 2805,
       :start-byte 2416}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "46ffbe85d4b54130ea201fad37643048f542031b04272ca342700b727c692b9d",
       :raw
       "Gravity rejects atomics whose target memory order cannot be represented.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/cd91cf2f0cf0b0aff0ee563a00dcf00ded95cf4a7999ac984df9663ddeac62e0",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/ab7c12afc5d1cc106a5775ea",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5894,
       :start-byte 5821}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "9c3adb83d2ee8a043fcedfde598f148eeec1077c144bdbb5888f688fb1ec8517",
       :raw
       "Gravity rejects shared mutable state without synchronization or ownership\ntransfer evidence.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/4dd296c1edb0ab9be55b297851c2609dfa75ed3d2ff23e45ba0998d6a8c4b9fd",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/bd4b4fd148946dcae3c0bfd0",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5759,
       :start-byte 5666}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "20ab93f015457ac95eaf0790a0d47ebcc565a5b4edf33cc2509347ce95040c4d",
       :raw
       "- `P5`, `P9`, `P10`, and `P11` define native, distributed, AI, and GPU\n  concurrency constraints.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c7d500ea911c55129411ac12c82ace17ceceb0d5bddaeda3f537f8d7a90960c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/c7830dcb57de24603c267243",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1962,
       :start-byte 1864}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "8f2fb9d85f7043eae79cef926d0779e343f89c044018661efaed272ff426a187",
       :raw
       "- `SAFE5`, `SAFE10`, and `SAFE15` define resource cleanup, capabilities, and\n  proof records.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c7d500ea911c55129411ac12c82ace17ceceb0d5bddaeda3f537f8d7a90960c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/d3c5ab8bd0db9b309bd06b63",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1864,
       :start-byte 1770}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "65404a028f431776cc2e95fcd8ac58c2eb6ecac07f37270c5cd6e6311f4658f3",
       :raw "- atomics and locks for systems code,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/6c2c81458ca7f37e3f0a080b7a3ad6fd90b62d4b026c14cbdeaa7ee76dc8cc66",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/e730c81f31922cc2497071b1",
