       :raw
       "- The runtime manifest must declare selected concurrency model, scheduler,\n  thread provider, task lifecycle, cancellation policy, failure propagation,\n  memory-order support, and replay behavior when durable execution is involved.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/2defdcdbd78609242dd38b2c58c99a10b8d6aa903e591ba660ef400c9416f959",
