       "4485b62d285123056c28b74ec62033eb2535f62c9d99111542a46fa45c2e5596",
       :raw "- active profile and target,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/ccb337f51d8b61e7756f0a30e60ea7da1f0c38e91d45fbc4b701f923f5312a3f",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/08615f873ac4b78138803a28",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 3073,
       :start-byte 3044}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "4f8b556f2d53372429536a0f95b4ee8e91a1c8e5916e2f3c9432880f4ff1797e",
       :raw
       "- `C2` through `C18` define reader, macro, compiler, incremental, and plugin\n  artifacts.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/bab12b1341fe6d03be0540c33f21cd7f0a4669ae58a32043ccaa0ef0e887721f",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/3911defd3d7b40e8d8d4fd09",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 1945,
       :start-byte 1855}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "982cd2499094b88dd48028bb2d9a58b7468eb979a0ccc3890396e87d201df082",
       :raw
       "- `SAFE10`, `SAFE11`, and `SAFE12` define capabilities, taint, and generated\n  code safety.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/bab12b1341fe6d03be0540c33f21cd7f0a4669ae58a32043ccaa0ef0e887721f",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/512d941231979a93e7b0308c",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 2037,
       :start-byte 1945}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "d97e6725768d19798009fccb391717dc682a4d8768d2a4b8dbc93b2cafa8b635",
       :raw
       "Gravity rejects interactive runtime availability in no-runtime, firmware,\nkernel, and hardware profiles.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/0701a70c16fc300b393dec958bc1f2b20a39db8dc8b24d9e08a46481492b2d1d",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/617b6a3a9814e01fbce8be8f",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 5171,
       :start-byte 5066}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "85e5b4082a329fca78755f8242148e56c69376cc8bf37b503883d99eb89f1047",
       :raw
       "- `R9-PROFILE` for interactive evaluation in profiles that forbid it.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/6f88124a2d6999868f4f232ae7ea9b57d15e4aff5b7a81361f0922ea3074c3e7",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/751ec991ab7acb03b3350dbc",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 4235,
       :start-byte 4165}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "43f8fbcbd4b8ae0a134678f6c8d5d2f73acdb7732762dfb5fda6cdf7aff57f98",
       :raw "- dynamic-eval rejection for incompatible profiles,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/f61329447b0ce20e6a016ae4a22f5b62e1055c722c58aa9c71e5f921fba6bf3e",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/95127314c43acf74881ea612",
