       :start-byte 5648}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "26cfe1fb9c658f19cff7875cb80df3159dd615f11c58c55108d2e04b42c8d34c",
       :raw
       "- `R1`, `R4`, `R11`, and `R12` define shared, managed, capability, and\n  observability runtime integration.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/bab12b1341fe6d03be0540c33f21cd7f0a4669ae58a32043ccaa0ef0e887721f",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/a12bb02adc6c9ebbe6d2d08e",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 2145,
       :start-byte 2037}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "3b2e05f2960928efd9405d109d6ddb6ad5f5087452ec330380cb0b376a00b832",
       :raw
       "Diagnostics must include session id, source span or evaluated-form id, profile,\ntarget, compiler phase, capability, affected artifact, hermeticity status, and\nremediation.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/6d2b2c46b81e5a0d5c4274ae6ac5ee9681c085af10de3f054f067f9cca7dac37",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/a419b9c079e8a1bafa590f71",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 4973,
       :start-byte 4801}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "c1fc1b15160ff6dde92404332a4cc71c422e4d4aa97edc20afeeaf3064d8384d",
       :raw
       "Interactive evaluation is a runtime service with authority and reproducibility\nrisks. It is unavailable in profiles that forbid dynamic evaluation or managed\nservices, and it must record enough session state to explain generated code,\ndiagnostics, and artifacts.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/83c8a9ec0edfc1e6068bf9e36c55e3875da07d106df5a451df13917f06882e0b",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/b8a922a6d114f816ad7a4f97",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 854,
       :start-byte 591}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "463fabc00cde3d2085d5aa47c0806872c686448c94b270579bf5f492c559e12d",
       :raw
       "- `P3`, `P4`, and `P13` define meta, hosted, and profile compatibility rules.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/bab12b1341fe6d03be0540c33f21cd7f0a4669ae58a32043ccaa0ef0e887721f",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/b8d1e7c8704e528180faa7aa",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 1855,
       :start-byte 1777}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "e2a3ea781183c497e6cd22ecdebd847f967e80307cd6723e40e4135a64d5f7cd",
       :raw
       "```clojure\n{:artifact :gravity/repl-runtime\n :family :interactive\n :profile :meta\n :services #{:incremental-eval :macro-inspection :hot-reload :debugger}\n :requires #{:session-policy :capability-grants :audit-log\n             :incremental-state}\n :records #{:session-transcript :typed-core-snapshot :mir-diff}\n :rejects #{:dynamic-eval-forbidden-profile :unhermetic-session-state\n            :undeclared-interactive-io}}\n```\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/9b4f6025e5ceb96d8459d520491f29b225d54f0ee69dd803bae0321629134899",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/db6436431064a55322aea761",
       :kind :example,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 2910,
       :start-byte 2485}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "84ad3958608521651fdc55c6975efb2197089cdfea010707071c5a69d80d4e9e",
       :raw
       "- Interactive evaluation must pass macro, type, effect, capability, safety,\n  profile, and package checks before code executes.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/b8b06e97f376a566ec3820ffc9cc22d23e7ffeb26be81d2f24a24656f2f93cad",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/e1ff2a4683d668ab1f91df1f",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 1211,
       :start-byte 1083}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "aac332293eee6e293b2dd4d90309732780d05266798361cc76bc3029d8832864",
       :raw
       "- The REPL runtime manifest must declare session profile, target, sandbox\n  policy, compiler phase visibility, namespace state, capability grants,\n  persistence policy, audit policy, and artifact emission mode.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/b8b06e97f376a566ec3820ffc9cc22d23e7ffeb26be81d2f24a24656f2f93cad",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/fad5b842989a0a5bd51db507",
