       "53a4010a8888cc46eb1c965dc0ade65841acf2a8e03ea07f8fecd68293ce515d",
       :raw
       "Distributed and AI workflows must record task scheduling decisions when replay\ndepends on them. Side-effecting concurrent steps need idempotency, event-log, or\ncompensation records. Replay cannot issue network, database, model, or tool\ncalls twice unless the graph declares them replay-safe.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/54242e72f865bd0e8429e19653975fc90aeb386e6f5b99c8347ce5edae6436ae",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/8398f06a984fc1c5bd71554a",
       :kind :condition,
