      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "75d2146801091809395de7eb01f57800796659593634becb7f924766c07b13e7",
       :raw
       "Safe wrappers declare required preconditions, runtime checks, ensures clauses,\nownership transfers, failure behavior, and unsafe implementation calls. Wrapper\ncontracts must be testable. A wrapper may expose a safe API only when all unsafe\nforeign assumptions are checked, proven, or isolated behind explicit unsafe\npolicy.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/1c2c01393646aba176106a213108929c43867eccf7e55ce4f660e8626434378d",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r10/41a2546233a8c74513229a4c",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R10",
       :end-byte 3837,
       :start-byte 3513}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "f3f856ba390abfd7380209b9ddcb731046f349a8338b57f6bf218bf4b25d037f",
       :raw
       "- Symbol resolution and dynamic loading must follow package and deployment\n  policy.\n",
