      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "eae6fc1fc57da089d2f43b46bd508dbf89a5902cabfb14ccef3e32ce5e231bba",
       :raw
       "- Callback entry from foreign code must re-enter Gravity through capability,\n  thread-affinity, taint, and error adapters.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/5e4eb80646a8abc657d693dfb235aa8d03b044b89ca432bc210fa9edb631f159",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r10/6514fd006793b86a80f8945c",
