       :document-id "R10",
       :end-byte 1698,
       :start-byte 1575}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "f6f783638d5731bda9618f046db2b81364d507773c099437f72fbd77c86debaf",
       :raw
       "- Foreign effects such as IO, `:memory/raw`, network, process, shell, database,\n  device, GPU, model, tool, or secret access require capabilities.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/5e4eb80646a8abc657d693dfb235aa8d03b044b89ca432bc210fa9edb631f159",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r10/6eebca3241f76c7a3b7d4ffd",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R10",
       :end-byte 1467,
       :start-byte 1320}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "bafc83a885cfe2b4b4006b4f3a768e197a33705588fab51abeae08cd289e9ef7",
       :raw
       "```clojure\n{:artifact :gravity/ffi-runtime\n :family :ffi\n :services #{:foreign-call :layout-adapter :error-conversion\n             :callback-adapter :safe-wrapper}\n :requires #{:abi :calling-convention :layout-tests :lifetime-policy\n             :ownership-transfer :effect-map}\n :records #{:ffi-binding-manifest :symbol-resolution :unsafe-audit}\n :rejects #{:raw-extern-from-safe-code :pointer-without-lifetime\n            :foreign-effect-without-grant}}\n```\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/f21abaa76e14a2bdee60d00297bc39876701fd0d5d9c5ca8f0ff1675f380eb4d",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r10/707e9ae0e580843a9c3d5244",
       :kind :example,
       :document-id "R10",
       :end-byte 2884,
       :start-byte 2424}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "c8c6b631e1fbe389ca86749473e4a3447c4a040e406617ca9436cd9bed537ecd",
       :raw
       "Foreign handles record provider, raw representation, lifetime owner, release\nfunction, nullability, thread affinity, aliasing policy, and taint. Callbacks\nfrom foreign code re-enter Gravity with source-like generated origins, runtime\ncapability checks, error translation, and scheduler/thread checks.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/22de103e66d824603b69bcb2f59bdf8a0484867c84b59433821a4be5ffd61446",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r10/7505c2f5eba1703d2ee91954",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R10",
       :end-byte 4173,
       :start-byte 3872}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "91c6b0712ec510935a6a362263ae607c2d6a5738121c5e6ea31bbb3590cf9e76",
       :raw
       "The FFI runtime mediates calls across foreign language, ABI, host, native,\nmobile, Wasm, database, device, and platform boundaries. Raw foreign APIs are\nunsafe by default. Safe wrappers must prove or check type, layout, lifetime,\nnullability, ownership transfer, effects, capabilities, thread affinity, and\nerror conversion.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/a87ef3c02ae7d152ad3eb4b177a4d881a0f2d190b63ac1338907723df7d1b84c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r10/76d5a4c26b28463c45249a3e",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R10",
       :end-byte 642,
       :start-byte 317}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "387944acf982967b2b164cb8fad8f2e81623c5604f1c59aa72ba679e6561daab",
       :raw
       "Gravity rejects foreign effects outside declared capabilities.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/862a24c7ef801507938c83c0007a4b91be487ce109f212dd337a3b27f5596f08",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r10/7a3cd545fda1bf7eec01f11e",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "R10",
       :end-byte 5345,
       :start-byte 5282}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/121-r10-ffi-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "bdc5330ccfa3ba94ed7225cc531a8a7adc7d93e9ae983d7a8b82cee45977f6fe",
       :raw
       "- Every FFI binding must have ABI, calling convention, symbol identity, layout,\n  alignment, nullability, lifetime, ownership, effect, capability, and error\n  mapping records.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
