       :raw-sha256
       "9bacf2c01d9257c4b58bb1e5ce34709987e4502447fa000619c7b402b4732750",
       :raw
       "Bundles must be portable enough for tooling but constrained enough to respect\ncapability and secret policy.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/8bfbddade78528870d0bb3cd60b93ed52f0057364540658f3afce389afa82b33",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/18c725fc3e4a1e00b1711f64",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 4549,
       :start-byte 4441}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "3cd3178823f150e58110614e5551ffe338c79883316d1d2d4dceb228dc64650c",
       :raw
       "```clojure\n{:artifact :gravity/runtime-observability\n :events #{:panic :trap :allocation :task :actor :workflow\n           :model :tool :ffi :capability :safety-check}\n :requires #{:source-map :artifact-manifest :redaction-policy\n             :sink-capability}\n :emits #{:structured-log :trace :metric :diagnostic-bundle}\n :rejects #{:secret-leak :ungranted-observability-sink\n            :diagnostic-without-source-or-artifact}}\n```\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/34c810e85374d1983a069889cb5cce11f5cd01f99a219aecff0fd9168fbd4034",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/2e57adba6ccfb62d7ee07129",
       :kind :example,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 2992,
       :start-byte 2558}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "2830b4cfcece4536ab4c855f4006effdff2319200083bb1a37da56f3f9c668ab",
       :raw
       "Redaction policy covers secrets, credentials, prompts, model outputs, user data,\ntainted inputs, raw memory, environment values, package tokens, database rows,\nand deployment identifiers. Observability sinks are capability-bearing targets.\nA deployment may allow local debug logs while denying network telemetry.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/87cc7c1109203d2942bfb1b65698f22056e193ee7924c97324df7603092d551d",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/2f840d06edcec1eea3b658a8",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 4050,
       :start-byte 3737}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "c00329bb8186ad251df8ddb8896cc8644f847c310a0c1df4319908c2f6308420",
       :raw "- Capability decision report.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/f7da84530eaa15ad89d33c108b7c92c5094a5027bf4fe13e2b1859d1849c1f11",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/517b38efbd18b4c8dd75058e",
       :kind :artifact,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 2428,
       :start-byte 2398}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "164939b35a41dae5f73be9dc726d08d870a52763bcfb468b54ebd6c7dd01653e",
       :raw
       "Diagnostics must include event id, runtime family, artifact id, source span or\ngenerated-origin edge, sink, redaction policy, capability, missing schema or\nlink, and remediation.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/ee85b60afff746f7dbf2d40b52dda7908a5d645e2e3d5d2788eb7d20c9f30cfd",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/60c8a24e3350cf396aeb2107",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 5489,
       :start-byte 5310}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "399c8131a5925f263515d622af036bceafdda0af33bf3960d09911c715bff58e",
       :raw
       "Runtime observability emits structured facts about execution without creating\nnew authority or leaking secrets. It connects runtime failures, safety checks,\ncapability decisions, panics, traps, allocations, tasks, actors, workflows,\nmodel/tool calls, FFI boundaries, and performance events to Gravity source,\ngenerated origins, artifacts, profiles, targets, effects, capabilities, and\nreplay records.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/578956abc7ffcf9ada1d605c73e92d2b9e6387487337312c6523244bccaa9a3c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/7449983d01d77aebcedd463d",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 744,
       :start-byte 343}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "fdc4cc5eaa0d497f3861ed840572947f9d90261fab62e748c3916cd3592af8b9",
       :raw "- capability decisions,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/18e416766e279a89eea9ae1150c63d0f424567152d8b5f2ece26b20b0457bcd3",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/7625a00e13c6b738843a05ac",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 4285,
       :start-byte 4261}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "ccd81e4cfe99c5f55446b7618a1ca9d90984ce0fb4f6a49f437c05ee4ffbd3b1",
       :raw
       "- `R12-SINK` for observability sinks without capability grants.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/645f28cef199bf1ced75d3f0dd67c203e1937eb1c69500b9ca9b0179d368d85e",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/79a7579742be57980f315efd",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 4688,
       :start-byte 4624}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "ec03f916fe84f156beab074ee62bb80fc954cf83788fcaf59000cd96e1466bac",
       :raw
       "- Every runtime event must have an event schema, runtime family, artifact id,\n  source/provenance link when available, profile, target, effect/capability data\n  when relevant, severity, and redaction policy.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/5fd321515ec3dbb11786b6b0f336e46e13a7adea98ff478620f31a28210cb7e1",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/94b53497451b570fdddfa22c",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 1115,
       :start-byte 907}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "21a25b0773d8a3d62d1f6ccc2f73ce8d0d74b970fcbe6ae2f2de2521f6511c7d",
       :raw
       "- Package, deployment, testing, and tooling phases consume diagnostic bundles.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R12/source/049459d0bdd002836d81daeabefa93613304204bd7b5b3a06287dc820b9d32c8",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r12/98b772213f9175826b74837f",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R12",
       :end-byte 2195,
       :start-byte 2116}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/123-r12-runtime-observability-and-diagnostics-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
