       :raw-sha256
       "e3b7b0eed1816712bd4297066edc2e3faf8a167b68897a0171a25d0f6eca6cfa",
       :raw
       "- `SAFE2`, `SAFE3`, `SAFE4`, `SAFE5`, `SAFE6`, `SAFE8`, `SAFE10`, and `SAFE15`\n  define memory, ownership, regions, resources, borrowing, concurrency,\n  capabilities, and proofs.\n",
