      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/116-r5-memory-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "1c416ee19272d7296a8532c79b00a7b9b3be4cc3dbea0adea992ae842798ec51",
       :raw
       "- `B2`, `B3`, `B4`, `B8`, `B9`, `B13`, `R1`, and `R3` define backend and native\n  runtime integration.\n",
