      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/116-r5-memory-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "940e23fa3202cba48e6a92b8343214b571e31bc3ddcd9c593bbda3ae9e14912f",
       :raw "- raw-memory unsafe wrapper tests,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R5/source/06630024c86052339615b7f2ef6c4f35a7229d550ec73c62db32a7da081ecdd3",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r5/a56460aa5d02c68743e7fef8",
       :kind :acceptance-case,
       :document-id "R5",
       :end-byte 5790,
       :start-byte 5755}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/116-r5-memory-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "7ab7d1357b91e0f6556fd8f4a2f783d9fa701b17603d9e6dd144de473608c973",
       :raw "Gravity rejects raw memory as a safe default.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R5/source/a32522e6ae60bd8d9ce1953009b1d799c25d17bf08e8c49d7090512b4eaa5699",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r5/fea9915eb01859c4eb1b019e",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "R5",
       :end-byte 5145,
       :start-byte 5099}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/116-r5-memory-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "e116b52a346e3b12446a630bfcfcd6617f3530d6f2b17b657ac7a41ba5a7edfb",
       :raw
       "Memory runtime providers are profile-selected services. They do not weaken the\ncompiler's ownership, lifetime, region, resource, aliasing, initialization, and\nunsafe checks.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R5/source/40fd085d629b7e345e709be9850d9021eddbeb942510440deb2182fd3f7c1328",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r5/fee1692b46e6ec440b5134d7",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R5",
       :end-byte 709,
       :start-byte 535}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "6a73f9b7b6fe9a051ca8262dc1f967f99420576c2ed2ba4af8f50126ce4e043f",
       :raw
       "- `R6-CAPABILITY` for concurrent effects without authority.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/604b2046503954470bbc35f393ddd2fb6de51960e40a7316636bf659e191afdd",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/04edff27bbd9c672b9bc7e1c",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5274,
       :start-byte 5214}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "f34e1bafdb06a536c997732d9935725bff9c0833849f2d14e885249e22fca20f",
       :raw
       "Diagnostics must include source span, task/actor/channel id, profile, runtime\nfamily, scheduler, effect, capability, synchronization object, missing proof or\nschema, and remediation.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/e9571b0e29864aab72167c671a13ccf0c67cfad58eaa378a4dd0d8b2ae469c24",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/20d7a0f8dd7690fab68d8ee9",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5586,
       :start-byte 5403}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "df6bea8e6b0dfb1b2da8010b96039d3b6ed8809889cbb19d446cc3c9742015ec",
       :raw
       "Gravity rejects replay-sensitive concurrency that repeats side effects\nsilently.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/609f399b05910e4d253760a6b9bc6635a14d8ba959ef4bcddaab4889f89b7da9",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/2a56d87812cf667871c0ea00",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5976,
       :start-byte 5895}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "1430ab7b2c9c41564fd5947d8ba5b7d041cb07c25798188dde1d8523b3e65d40",
       :raw "- `SAFE8` defines concurrency and data-race rules.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c7d500ea911c55129411ac12c82ace17ceceb0d5bddaeda3f537f8d7a90960c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/33175ff1df97271c915c9e91",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1770,
       :start-byte 1719}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "6f370c209a289ce5cd9a5b6a1aa20967c479c143a434d10e480e4742a6334076",
       :raw
       "Structured tasks record parent scope, child task id, source span, captured\nvalues, ownership transfers, effects, capabilities, cancellation behavior,\ntimeout, result type, and failure mapping. Detached tasks require a lifecycle\nowner, cleanup path, and observability hooks.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c6578b57c206da9aed997a8cd77ee858349ac424d02f67d12b36c81cee0d261",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/3a404d3497003bd29b037aa7",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 3765,
       :start-byte 3491}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "5d06c89261e46665c58dcb166f3dbda13adf8f8b4879234a77bf12791a2cd698",
       :raw
       "The runtime enforces the compiler's data-race, ownership-transfer,\nsynchronization, cancellation, and effect-ordering contracts. It is not a way to\nshare mutable state outside `SAFE8`.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/f6b7baa3619e09c90af8aed3561859597dd0116c6b0efa1390e28ec76a5742f6",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/4ae94841bf49c7264a95b908",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 754,
       :start-byte 569}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "e3396dabab8d987051cf048d953d8869f72e5e52b6cc64038ca3a48bfb9b8b7a",
       :raw "- capability checks for concurrent effects,\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/5d7934ecbed7a4d7364acde0ecefa6a0bc4928020c8473c10b0512b65ad4323e",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/4bc7ed838d55309e40f6fd6f",
       :kind :acceptance-case,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 6319,
       :start-byte 6275}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "fe24daca522b243798cec48ff90362188586de4a418dc31eb7211994214ae5a8",
       :raw
       "- `R6-BLOCKING` for blocking effects unsupported by the selected runtime.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/604b2046503954470bbc35f393ddd2fb6de51960e40a7316636bf659e191afdd",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/6df9c63446698e1dd8de140d",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5214,
       :start-byte 5140}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "0e1a61ebafff06b47bb817a7d469ca977ec15cc8b2db5448864e8813d0897b9d",
       :raw
       "- Blocking IO, network, database, filesystem, model, tool, and timer effects\n  require effects and capabilities.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/2defdcdbd78609242dd38b2c58c99a10b8d6aa903e591ba660ef400c9416f959",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/6e3d4f19b629048291d94daf",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1602,
       :start-byte 1489}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "016cb5efe075d790e3c69a4061f967bdb6a32a0e15b5b11472947714d633e1ca",
       :raw
       "- `R6-REPLAY` for concurrent side effects that cannot be replayed safely.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/604b2046503954470bbc35f393ddd2fb6de51960e40a7316636bf659e191afdd",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/7d614b2746677ee9375f410c",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 5348,
       :start-byte 5274}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "53a4010a8888cc46eb1c965dc0ade65841acf2a8e03ea07f8fecd68293ce515d",
       :raw
       "Distributed and AI workflows must record task scheduling decisions when replay\ndepends on them. Side-effecting concurrent steps need idempotency, event-log, or\ncompensation records. Replay cannot issue network, database, model, or tool\ncalls twice unless the graph declares them replay-safe.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/54242e72f865bd0e8429e19653975fc90aeb386e6f5b99c8347ce5edae6436ae",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/8398f06a984fc1c5bd71554a",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 4615,
       :start-byte 4323}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "c99693b36f847ee79b0e752e52dc40dab1d9015f582627c0e0fdf61623884946",
       :raw
       "```clojure\n{:artifact :gravity/concurrency-runtime\n :family :concurrency\n :models #{:structured-tasks :atomics :channels :actors}\n :scheduler :native-thread-pool\n :requires #{:ownership-transfer :sync-policy :cancellation-policy}\n :records #{:task-tree :sync-graph :actor-mailboxes}\n :rejects #{:unsynchronized-shared-mutable-state :orphan-task\n            :unreplayable-side-effect}}\n```\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0000880fa314d950b6c2c9fd69af7955b87c043981d9ac30f76b4996b3c56400",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/a89c8ca9cb1677c9e771db65",
       :kind :example,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 2805,
       :start-byte 2416}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "3a1eb304ef6f6fd3974c016d1d075b2d59dad19d3285fac84e4cdf25da762d88",
       :raw
       "Each model declares whether it allows blocking, cancellation, priority, detached\nexecution, thread affinity, replay, and failure propagation.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/03ff27cbad6c00ed15d2293745a793d864b66409a6d0b17ee8342d8961e06f54",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/bb843da0b038aeb8795ad557",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 3463,
       :start-byte 3321}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "20ab93f015457ac95eaf0790a0d47ebcc565a5b4edf33cc2509347ce95040c4d",
       :raw
       "- `P5`, `P9`, `P10`, and `P11` define native, distributed, AI, and GPU\n  concurrency constraints.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c7d500ea911c55129411ac12c82ace17ceceb0d5bddaeda3f537f8d7a90960c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/c7830dcb57de24603c267243",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1962,
       :start-byte 1864}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "8f2fb9d85f7043eae79cef926d0779e343f89c044018661efaed272ff426a187",
       :raw
       "- `SAFE5`, `SAFE10`, and `SAFE15` define resource cleanup, capabilities, and\n  proof records.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c7d500ea911c55129411ac12c82ace17ceceb0d5bddaeda3f537f8d7a90960c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/d3c5ab8bd0db9b309bd06b63",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1864,
       :start-byte 1770}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "dfac874ded11d69989bef292ae7dd7a133eff4e41ce91e47600ba65a7b319819",
       :raw
       "- Durable workflow concurrency must be replay-safe and idempotent where side\n  effects can repeat.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/2defdcdbd78609242dd38b2c58c99a10b8d6aa903e591ba660ef400c9416f959",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/d835876e78887f08819ae96e",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 1701,
       :start-byte 1602}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/117-r6-concurrency-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "b6f215b0921dd322decec1d4afb41ebcbc84a1df9d989b14f6af7c727c07911a",
       :raw
       "- `B8`, `B10`, `R1`, `R3`, `R5`, `R7`, and `R8` define backend and runtime\n  integration.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R6/source/0c7d500ea911c55129411ac12c82ace17ceceb0d5bddaeda3f537f8d7a90960c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r6/ffb5b1cf895a3be4bd0fb92f",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R6",
       :end-byte 2052,
       :start-byte 1962}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/118-r7-distributed-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "393d4eb17af24bae111460a101c4a6e054c5f1339b2e5178ff519bdca87fce16",
       :raw "- `B10` defines workflow graph artifacts.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R7/source/30fcc8c34a60dffeceb9449c1a1685f26cf75f346073ccc895ab68c3a1a012ba",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r7/01b955104691cc21d09f3a0d",
       :kind :context,
       :document-id "R7",
       :end-byte 1923,
       :start-byte 1881}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/118-r7-distributed-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "a8c7e8b1306ff46de3ca43ae318e417482aa54ceaf7e3c38415247e5a921c95e",
       :raw
       "- Runtime authorization must enforce database, network, service, model, tool,\n  secret, and write/destructive capabilities.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R7/source/4f5c57248789060d3f086afb42dd272c50458218105bbb1fcc96f477392a692a",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r7/02e5f6f369523d933cc6a6c9",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R7",
       :end-byte 1693,
       :start-byte 1569}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/118-r7-distributed-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "482149eae76095ec467f98e86b8e8c67a156824ad37ea4cacaffabe365ccf7de",
       :raw
       "Event-log records include workflow id, step id, event kind, input digest, output\ndigest, effect, capability, provider, retry attempt, error, timestamp source,\nand source origin. Replay reads recorded events instead of repeating\nnondeterministic effects.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R7/source/877d603fed38b3a3763ab4f5d55d2fa16b5ac0af2806513a81b1b70b7436bdbc",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r7/187b9805ff08a4416b4584e9",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R7",
       :end-byte 3799,
       :start-byte 3545}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/118-r7-distributed-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "3250b947b89b1be182092f19f6e5176fd520bd31ee4a291d0095a82ea5dda80b",
       :raw
       "Actor records include mailbox schema, state schema, snapshot policy, delivery\nguarantee, ordering guarantee, backpressure policy, failure behavior, and\ncapability requirements. Messages and persisted state carry schema version,\ntaint, retention, migration, and compatibility records.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
