       "c8c6b631e1fbe389ca86749473e4a3447c4a040e406617ca9436cd9bed537ecd",
       :raw
       "Foreign handles record provider, raw representation, lifetime owner, release\nfunction, nullability, thread affinity, aliasing policy, and taint. Callbacks\nfrom foreign code re-enter Gravity with source-like generated origins, runtime\ncapability checks, error translation, and scheduler/thread checks.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/22de103e66d824603b69bcb2f59bdf8a0484867c84b59433821a4be5ffd61446",
