       :raw-sha256
       "b11c0e921517ae5444b87ed16f72db26881ae4b37616724b964df584426cd170",
       :raw
       "- Model output, retrieved documents, tool output, and memory values are tainted\n  until validated for a specific sink.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R8/source/d8e63af17323c96a37c0d4f1b1e218454185e5e9db9ee4a06e9f5eae7193f3d1",
