       "e6e4231b3015bf32360b9ff6338824dc6f63acbe86d96ca53484be40f6607a3d",
       :raw
       "The runtime treats model and tool behavior as effectful, capability-gated,\ntainted, auditable, and often nondeterministic. Prompt text, retrieved content,\ntool results, and model output cannot create authority.\n",
